i Griffin","Katlyn Nichol","Stephen A. Smith","Jeanté Godlock","Shakira Ja'nai Paye","Stephanie Charles","Gianna Altieri","Kevin Symons","Brian Michael Jones","Nick Carson","Nathan Morris","Wanya Morris","Shawn Stockman","Keraun Harris","Seth Coltan","Kimberly Dawn Guerrero","Dylan Summerall","Dawson Fletcher","Karole Foreman","Austin Boyce","Salome Azizi","Marlon Aquino","Madison Shamoun","Biz Markie","Jasmine Ashanti","Leigh Bush","Terrence Terrell","Kiff VandenHeuvel","Eileen Barnett","Caitlyn Knisely","Mallian Butler","Eric C. Lynch","Stewart Skelton","Daniel Lee Robertson III","Paul Van Scott","Hilda Boulware","Kathryn Taylor Smith","Bodhi del Rosario","Shannon McClung","Spike Lee","Chris Hansen","Patrick Rafferty","Alexandra Hoover","Shaan Sharma","Marcus T. Thomas","Christian Benz Belnavis","Simone Biles","Janice LeAnn Brown","Cassidey Fralin","Nicole Pacent","Dayna Dooley","Malik S","Danny Brown","Valentina Lucido","Will Sterling","Sarah Cortez","Elia Cantu","Allyson Felix","Paul McKinney","Christine Heneise","Shane Costa","A.J. Tannen","Sarah Randall Hunt"],"screenwriters":["Gail Lerner","Kenya Barris","Larry Wilmore","Jessica Poter","Scott Weinger","Emily Halpern","Sarah Haskins","Owen H.M. Smith","Peter Saji","Esa Lewis","Doug Hall","Marquita Robinson","Yamara Taylor","Eric Horsted","Sam Laybourne","Lisa McQuillan","Lisa Muse Bryant","Lizzie Donaldson","Jenifer Rice-Genzuk","Laura Gutin","Stacy Traub","Yvette Lee Bowser","Kenny Smith Jr.","Nick Adams","Melanie Boysaw","Steve Vitolo","Robb Chavis","Isaiah Lester","Vijal Patel","Mary Fitzgerald","Courtney Lilly"],"cinematographers":["Anthony Hardwick","Rob Sweeney"],"composers":["Transcenders"],"reviews":[{"author":"liberita","text":"Je pravdou, že humor Black-ish je takmer výlučne založený na rasových otázkach, ktoré má koniec-koncov už aj v samotnom názve; a je tiež pravdou, že niekedy to už pôsobí až príliš silene. Napriek tomu sa na eskapádach tejto bláznivej rodinky dá dobre pobaviť a Black-ish tak považujem za jeden z lepších súčasných sitkomov.(24.09.2015)","stars":4},{"author":"Tom Riddle","text":"Taková moderní rodinka tak trochu na černo, příjemná oddychová komedie beze smíchové stopy v čele s Mahalikem a dcerou Diany Ross, kde je rasa častou živnou půdou pro všeljaké joky (Black people just aren't republicans!), ale zároveň nabízí dostatečně barvité a sympatické charaktery (především duo prarodičů a malá dvojčata si dávají každou scénu), aby to nebylo neustále o jednom a tom samém. Oproti Modern Family je to celé jednodušší a klasicky sitcomovější, ale ono není vůbec špatné být slabší verzí jednoho z nejlepších aktuálních sitcomů.(25.05.2015)","stars":4},{"author":"Jenda","text":"Na mě příliš \"černá\" záležitost. Seriál, který ukazuje, že černoši jsou vlastně ještě větší rasisti, než kdejaký běloch. Tématem i humorem je mi poměrně vzdálený.(28.01.2016)","stars":2}],"vods":[{"platform":"Disney+","url":"https://srv.tunefindforfans.com/showads/track/srvclk.php?aid=100006796&lp=https%3A//www.disneyplus.com/en-cz/browse/entity-76f43549-f181-462f-94ec-2fe34b9abad5"},{"platform":"SledovaniTV","url":"https://sledovanitv.cz/epg/event/orf1:20260707e9870c0e3a849b248b655900ee1a6048"}],"link":"https://www.csfd.cz/film/398932-black-ish/prehled/","csfd_id":398932,"root_id":398932,"root_title_id":null,"root_title":null,"root_slug":null,"is_toplevel":true,"season_no":null,"episode_no":null,"season_count":8,"episode_count":176,"is_running":false,"cadence_days":null,"first_vod_date":null,"last_vod_date":null,"episodes":[]}